# --- Tessera harness ---
.tessera/logs/*
!.tessera/logs/README.md
# .tessera/config.yml is COMMITTED, deliberately — it carries `test:`, the command an agent
# must never have to guess. A test command that vanishes on a fresh clone is useless to the
# unsupervised agent it exists for. Keep secrets out of it, not the file out of git.
.mnemos/
.icpg/
.claude/.tdd-iteration-count

# Python (Tessera tooling)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
